repository-code: "https://github.com/tjogzt/paralog-sl-predictor"
url: "https://github.com/tjogzt/paralog-sl-predictor"
abstract: >-
  Full analysis pipeline for Delta Dependency (DD) — a simple, interpretable
  discovery-stage metric for prioritizing paralog-based synthetic lethality
  candidates from DepMap CRISPR screening data across 23 solid tumor types.
  Validated through CPTAC proteomics, PRISM drug screening, MSI stratification,
  and therapeutic window analysis.
keywords:
  - synthetic lethality
  - paralog compensation
  - DepMap
  - CPTAC proteomics
  - drug target discovery
  - therapeutic window
  - computational biology
